#: ../../about/introduction.rst:2 ../../porting/introduction/index.rst:2
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introducció"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:4
msgid ""
"Our goal is to create a copylefted libre mobile operating system. One you "
"can use, study, change and share; with all."
msgstr ""
"El nostre objectiu és crear un sistema operatiu mòbil lliure copyleft. Un "
"que es pot utilitzar, estudiar, canviar i compartir; amb tots."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:7
msgid "About UBports"
msgstr "Quant al UBports"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:9
msgid ""
"The project was founded by Marius Gripsgard in 2015 and in its infancy a "
"place where developers could share ideas and educate each other in hopes of "
"bringing the Ubuntu Touch platform to more mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"El projecte UBports va ser creat per en Marius Gripsgard el 2015 i, durant "
"la seva primera fase, era un lloc on els desenvolupadors podien compartir "
"idees i formar-se mútuament amb l'objectiu de portar la plataforma Ubuntu "
"Touch a més dispositius mòbils."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:11
msgid ""
"After Canonical suddenly announced `plans to terminate support for Ubuntu "
"Touch <https://insights.ubuntu.com/2017/04/05/growing-ubuntu-for-cloud-and-"
"iot-rather-than-phone-and-convergence/>`_ in April of 2017, UBports and its "
"sister projects began work on the source code; maintaining and expanding its "
"possibilities for the future. Today, UBports is a volunteer group, "
"formalised as a charitable foundation."
msgstr ""
"Després que Canonical anunciés sobtadament `el seu pla de finalitzar el "
"suport a Ubuntu Touch <https://insights.ubuntu.com/2017/04/05/growing-ubuntu-"
"for-cloud-and-iot-rather-than-phone-and-convergence/>`_ l'abril del 2017, "
"UBports i els seus projectes germans van començar a treballar en el codi "
"font, mantenint i ampliant les seves possibilitats per al futur. Avui, "
"UBports és un grup de voluntaris, formalitzat com a fundació benèfica."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:14
msgid "About the Documentation"
msgstr "Quant a la documentació"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:16
msgid ""
"Changes to the documentation are made by the UBports community. It is "
"written in reStructuredText and converted into this readable form by `Sphinx "
"<https://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/master/>`_, `recommonmark <http://"
"recommonmark.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_, and `Read the Docs <https://"
"readthedocs.io>`_. Start contributing by checking out "
"the :doc:`Documentation contribution document </contribute/documentation>`."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta documentació està sempre millorant gràcies als membres de la "
"comunitat de l'UBports. Està escrita en ReStructuredText i convertida a "
"aquesta forma llegible per l'`Sphinx <http://www.sphinx-doc.org/en/stable/>"
"`_, `ReCommonMark <http://recommonmark.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`_, i `Read "
"the Docs <https://readthedocs.io>`_. Podeu començar a contribuir llegint la "
":doc:`Introducció a la documentació </contribute/documentation>`."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:18
msgid ""
"All documents are licensed Creative Commons Attribution ShareAlike 4.0 (`CC-"
"BY-SA 4.0 <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>`_). Please give "
"attribution to \"The UBports Community\"."
msgstr ""
"Tots els documents tenen la llicència Creative Commons Attribution "
"ShareAlike 4.0 (`CC-BY-SA 4.0 <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/"
"4.0/>`_). Si us plau, atribuïu-ho a \"The UBports Community\"."

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:21
msgid "Attribution"
msgstr "Atribució"

#: ../../about/introduction.rst:23
msgid ""
"This documentation was heavily modeled after the `Godot Engine's "
"Documentation <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/>`_, by Juan "
"Linietsky, Ariel Manzur and the Godot community."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta documentació segueix molt properament el model `Godot Engine's "
"Documentation <http://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/>`_, atribució a Juan "
"Linietsky, Ariel Manzur i la comunitat Godot."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:2
msgid "Branch-naming convention"
msgstr "Convenció de l'anomenat de branques"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:4
msgid ""
"Our branch-naming convention ensures software can be built by our CI and "
"tested easily by other developers."
msgstr ""
"Les nostres convencions d'anomenat de branques asseguren que el programari "
"es pot compilar pel nostre CI i comprovat fàcilment per d'altres "
"desenvolupadors."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every Git repository's README file should state which branch-naming "
"convention is used and any deviations from the norm."
msgstr ""
"Cada fitxer README d'un dipòsit GIT hauria d'especificar quina convenció "
"d'anomenat de branques s'usa i possibles desviacions de la norma."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:9
msgid "Click-Packages"
msgstr "Paquets-click"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:11
msgid ""
"Software exclusively distributed as a click-package (and not also as a DEB) "
"only uses one ``master`` branch that is protected. Separate temporary "
"development branches with arbitrary descriptive names can be created and "
"merged into master when the time comes. Ideally Git tags or GitHub releases "
"should be used to mark and archive milestones in the development history."
msgstr ""
"El programari que es distribueix exclusivament com un paquet-click (i no "
"també com un deb) sols usa una branca ``master`` que està protegida. Les "
"branques temporals separades amb noms descriptius arbitraris es poden crear "
"i fusionar al master quan arribi el moment. Per marcar i arxivar fites a la "
"història de desenvolupament, s'hauria d'usar idealment etiquetes Git o "
"Github."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:14
msgid "DEB Packages"
msgstr "Paquets-deb"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:16
msgid ""
"To help us deliver our code into Ubuntu Touch as effortlessly as possible, "
"our CI automatically build our Git repositories into a number of APT "
"archives hosted at http://repo.ubports.com/, according to the branch name."
msgstr ""
"Per ajudar-nos a lliurar el nostre codi a Ubuntu Touch el més sense esforç "
"possible, el nostre CI construeix automàticament els nostres repositoris Git "
"en una sèrie d'arxius APT allotjats a http://repo.ubports.com/, segons el "
"nom de la branca."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:18
msgid "We maintain the following branches across Git repositories:"
msgstr "Mantenim les següents sucursals a través dels repositoris de Git:"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:22
msgid "Git branches"
msgstr "Branques del Git"

