msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:23
msgid "Base distro"
msgstr "Distro"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid "``main``, ``ubports/latest``"
msgstr "``main``, ``ubports/latest``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid ""
"Represents the latest development of Ubuntu Touch. All kinds of changes are "
"allowed in this branch."
msgstr ""
"Representa l'últim desenvolupament d'Ubuntu Touch. En aquesta oficina es "
"permeten tot tipus de canvis."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid "``devel-<Ubuntu LTS>`` (e.g. ``devel-noble``)"
msgstr "``devel-<Ubuntu LTS>`` (e.g. ``devel-noble``)"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:25
msgid "Latest or upcoming Ubuntu LTS."
msgstr "Darrera o propera Ubuntu LTS."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:28
msgid "``devel-debian``"
msgstr "``devel-debian``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:28
msgid "Debian testing."
msgstr "Proves de fum"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid "``ubports/<major version>.x`` (e.g. ``ubports/24.6.x``)"
msgstr "``ubports/<versió principal>.x`` (p.ex. ``ubports/24.6.x``)"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid ""
"Represents the code in a particular major version. It branches off of the "
"``main`` branch before the major release, and will become a part of the "
"releases of that major version. Only bugfixes and non-breaking changes are "
"allowed in this branch."
msgstr ""
"Representa el codi en una versió major en particular. S'aparta de la branca "
"``main`` abans del llançament principal, i es convertirà en una part dels "
"llançaments d'aquesta versió principal. En aquesta branca només es permeten "
"correccions d'errors i canvis no trencadors."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid "``<major version>.x`` (e.g. ``24.6.x``)"
msgstr "``<versió principal>.x`` (p.ex. ``24.6.x``)"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:30
msgid "Ubuntu LTS at the time of branching."
msgstr "Ubuntu LTS en el moment de la ramificació."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
msgid "``ubports/focal``"
msgstr "``ubports/focal``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
msgid ""
"A special case of ``ubports/<major version>.x``, which is branched after the "
"release of Ubuntu Touch 20.04 OTA-4."
msgstr ""
"Un cas especial de ``ubports/<versió principal>.x``, que es ramifica després "
"del llançament d'Ubuntu Touch 20.04 OTA-4."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
msgid "``focal``"
msgstr "``focal``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:38
#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid "Ubuntu 20.04 LTS."
msgstr "Ubuntu 20.04 LTS."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid "``ubports/focal_-_<ext>``"
msgstr "``ubports/focal_-_<ext>``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid ""
"Branches which use the deprecated \"branch extensions\" system for cross-"
"components changes. No longer recommended for usage."
msgstr ""
"Branques que utilitzen el sistema obsolet d'«extensions de ramificació» per "
"a canvis de components creuats. Ja no es recomana l'ús."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:43
msgid "``focal_-_<ext>``"
msgstr "``focal_-_<ext>``"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:48
msgid "``personal/<user>/<name>``, and any other branches."
msgstr "``personal/<usuari>/<nom>``, i qualsevol altra branca."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:48
msgid ""
"All other branches may be used for proposing merge requests or for other "
"reasons. Theses branches are not built by the CI unless proposed as a merge "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Totes les altres branques es poden utilitzar per proposar sol·licituds de "
"fusió o per altres motius. Aquestes branques no són construïdes per la CI "
"llevat que es proposin com a sol·licitud de fusió."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:48
msgid ""
"N/A, unless proposed as an MR against aforementioned branches (see below)."
msgstr ""
"N/A, llevat que es proposi com a MR contra les branques esmentades (vegeu "
"més avall)."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:55
msgid ""
"To ensure the ``main`` branch doesn't miss any changes, all changes must be "
"made against ``main`` branch first before backporting to the major release "
"branches. An exception is when a change is not applicable to the ``main`` "
"branch anymore due to other changes in that branch."
msgstr ""
"Per assegurar que la branca ``main`` no perdi cap canvi, tots els canvis "
"s'han de fer contra la branca ``main`` primer abans de tornar enrere a les "
"branques d'alliberament principals. Una excepció és quan un canvi ja no és "
"aplicable a la branca ``main`` a causa d'altres canvis en aquesta branca."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:58
msgid ""
"If the next development version is not available for testing yet, and you "
"need the change to be made available for install for testing, it's allowed "
"to temporarily target the changeset to the major version branch to get "
"packages built against that version. When the changeset is ready for merge, "
"the changeset must be re-targeted to the ``main`` branch."
msgstr ""
"Si la propera versió de desenvolupament encara no està disponible per a "
"proves, i necessiteu que el canvi estigui disponible per a instal·lar-lo per "
"a proves, se us permetrà dirigir temporalment el conjunt de canvis a la "
"branca de versió principal per a obtenir paquets construïts contra aquesta "
"versió. Quan el conjunt de canvis estigui llest per a fusionar-se, el "
"conjunt de canvis haurà de tornar a ser dirigit a la branca ``main`` ."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:61
msgid "APT archives for Merge Requests"
msgstr "Arxius APT per a sol·licituds de fusió"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:63
msgid ""
"In addition to archives mentioned above, we also create APT archives for MRs "
"made against our Git repositories. This allows us to test the result of the "
"build on real devices using ubports-qa_ before merging the code. For each "
"MR, the CI will build the code against all the same targets as the MR's "
"target branch, and then will append ``_-_PR_<repository name>_<MR number>`` "
"to them [1]_. For example:"
msgstr ""
"A més dels arxius esmentats anteriorment, també creem arxius APT per a MRs "
"(sol·licituds de fusió) realitzats contra els nostres repositoris Git. Això "
"ens permet provar el resultat de la construcció en dispositius reals "
"utilitzant ubports-qa_ abans de fusionar el codi. Per a cada MR, l'IC "
"construirà el codi contra tots els mateixos objectius que la branca de "
"destinació de l'MR, i després els afegirà ``_-_PR_<nom de dipòsit>_<número "
"MR>`` [1]_. Per exemple:"

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:65
msgid ""
"An MR numbered 100 made against the ``main`` branch of Git repository "
"``lomiri`` (when the current Ubuntu LTS is ``noble``) will have APT archives "
"named ``devel-noble_-_PR_lomiri_100`` *and* ``devel-debian_-_PR_lomiri_100``."
msgstr ""
"Un MR numerat 100 fet contra la branca ``main`` del repositori Git "
"``lomiri`` (quan l'actual Ubuntu LTS és ``noble``) tindrà arxius APT "
"anomenats ``devel-noble_-_PR_lomiri_100`` *i* ``devel-debian_-"
"_PR_lomiri_100``."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:66
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An MR numbered 125 made against the ``ubports/24.6.x`` branch of Git "
"repository ``morph-browser`` will have an APT archive named ``24.6.x_-"
"_PR_morph-browser_125``."
msgstr ""
"Un MR numerat 125 fet contra la branca  theubports/24.6.x. del repositori "
"Git .morph-browser. tindrà un arxiu APT anomenat  an24.6.x-PRmorph-"
"browser125.."

#: ../../about/process/branch-naming.rst:68
msgid ""
"The word ``PR`` stuck around from the time we hosted our code on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"La paraula ``PR`` es va mantenir des del moment en què vam allotjar el "
"nostre codi a GitHub."

#: ../../about/process/index.rst:2
msgid "Processes"
msgstr "Processos"

#: ../../about/process/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"This section of the documentation details standardized processes for "
"different teams."
msgstr ""
"Aquesta secció de la documentació detalla els processos estandarditzats per "
"a diferents equips."

#: ../../about/process/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"The process definitions are still a work in progress and need to be "
"completed by the respective teams."
msgstr ""
"Les definicions dels processos encara són un treball en curs i cal que els "
"diferents equips les completin."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:2
msgid "Issue-Tracking Guidelines"
msgstr "Guia de seguiment de problemes"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:4
msgid ""
"This document describes the standard process of dealing with issues in "
"UBports projects. (Not to be confused with the :doc:`guide on writing a good "
"bugreport </contribute/bugreporting>`.)"
msgstr ""
"Aquest document descriu el procés estàndard per tractar amb problemes nous "
"als projectes de l'UBports. No s'ha de confondre amb la guia :doc:`guia per "
"a l'escriptura d'un bon informe d'error </contribute/bugreporting>`."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:8
msgid "Where are bugs tracked?"
msgstr "On se segueixen els errors?"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:10
msgid ""
"The primary issue tracker for Ubuntu Touch is the `ubports/development/"
"ubuntu-touch GitLab project`_. This project tracks all system-level Ubuntu "
"Touch issues, and serves as an entry point for users to report issues "
"they've encountered."
msgstr ""
"El rastrejador principal de problemes d'Ubuntu Touch és el projecte `ubports/"
"development/ubuntu-touch GitLab project`_. Aquest projecte fa un seguiment "
"de tots els problemes d'Ubuntu Touch a nivell de sistema, i serveix com a "
"punt d'entrada perquè els usuaris informin dels problemes que han trobat."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:12
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, other projects in the group also have their issue trackers "
"enabled too:"
msgstr ""
"Mentrestant, altres projectes del grup també tenen els seus rastrejadors "
"d'incidències activats:"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:14
msgid ""
"Device-specific issues are tracked under each device's project under "
"`ubports/porting`_ group."
msgstr ""
"Els problemes específics del dispositiu es rastregen sota el projecte de "
"cada dispositiu sota el grup `ubports/porting`_ ."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:15
msgid ""
"Core applications under `ubports/development/apps`_ track their own issues."
msgstr ""
"Les aplicacions principals a `ubports/development/apps`_ fan un seguiment "
"dels seus propis problemes."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:16
msgid ""
"System issues can also be filed against each component under `ubports/"
"development/core`_ directly as well, if it's clear which component is "
"responsible for an issue."
msgstr ""
"Els problemes del sistema també es poden presentar contra cada component a "
"`ubports/development/core`_ directament, si està clar quin component és "
"responsable d'un problema."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:18
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GitLab allows showing `issues across the group`_, cross-project issue "
"reference, and issue transfer between projects, making the exact project an "
"issue is filed less important. If a port-specific or website issue ended up "
"in ubports/development/ubuntu-touch project, they can be moved to the "
"appropriate project."
msgstr ""
"GitLab permet mostrar  theemesos a través del grup., referència d'emissió "
"creuada i transferència d'emissió entre projectes, fent que el projecte "
"exacte sigui menys important. Si un problema específic del port o del lloc "
"web va acabar en un projecte d'ubports/desenvolupament/ubuntu-touch, es "
"poden traslladar al projecte apropiat."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:27
msgid "Labels"
msgstr "Etiquetes"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:29
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All issues — even closed ones — should be labeled to allow use of GitLab's "
"filtering. For example, these are `issues labeled 'Kind: enhancement' inside "
"ubports/development group`_. Consult the `GitLab help pages`_ to learn more "
"about searching and filtering."
msgstr ""
"Tots els problemes - fins i tot els tancats - s'haurien d'etiquetar per "
"permetre l'ús del filtratge global del GitHub. Per exemple «aquests són tots "
"els problemes etiquetats amb «enhancement» dins de  `@ubports <https://"
"github.com/"
"search?utf8=%E2%9C%93&q=is%3Aopen+org%3Aubports+label%3A%22feature+request%22&type=>"
"`_. Consulteu les `Pàgines d'ajuda <https://help.github.com/articles/about-"
"searching-on-github/>`__ per a més informació sobre la cerca i el filtratge."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:34
msgid ""
"The following labels are used inside UBports projects. Since merge requests "
"(MRs) in GitLab share the same set of labels, some of the labels below might "
"also apply to merge requests as well."
msgstr ""
"Les etiquetes següents s'utilitzen dins dels projectes UBports. Atès que les "
"sol·licituds de fusió (MR) a GitLab comparteixen el mateix conjunt "
"d'etiquetes, algunes de les etiquetes següents també es poden aplicar a les "
"sol·licituds de fusió."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:36 ../../appdev/webapp/index.rst:19
#: ../../systemdev/kernel-hal.rst:57
msgid "Todo"
msgstr "Todo"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:37
msgid ""
"Consider also writing a document about process of dealing with merge "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Considereu també escriure un document sobre el procés de tractar amb les "
"sol·licituds de fusió."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:39
msgid "**Kind:** describe the nature of the issue"
msgstr "**Kind:** descriu la naturalesa del problema"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Kind: bug**: this issue describes something that doesn't work correctly."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: error**: aquest problema descriu alguna cosa que no funciona "
"correctament."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Kind: enhancement**: this issue is a feature request or describes "
"something that can be improved."
msgstr ""
"**enhancement**: Millora - Aquest problema és una demanda de funcionalitat."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Kind: maintenance**: this issue describes a technical debt; something we "
"need to clean up."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: manteniment**: aquest problema descriu un deute tècnic; una cosa que "
"hem de netejar."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:43
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Kind: FTBFS**: this issue describes a \"Fails To Build From Source\" issue "
"(`an accronym from Debian`_)."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: FTBFS**: aquest problema descriu un problema de «Fails to Build From "
"Source» ().un accrònim de Debian).)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Kind: process**: this issue is a tracking issue for some process. For "
"example, a process on releasing an Ubuntu Touch release."
msgstr ""
"**Kind: processa**: aquest problema és un problema de seguiment per a algun "
"procés. Per exemple, un procés en llançar un llançament d'Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Kind: question**: This issue is a support request or general question. It "
"should be directed to forums instead."
msgstr ""
"**question**: Pregunta - Aquest problema és una demanda de suport o una "
"pregunta general."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:46
msgid "**Needs:** describe some action that can/has to be done"
msgstr "**Needs:** descriu alguna acció que es pot/ha de fer"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Needs: help from community**: the maintainers currently don't have "
"capacity to solve this issue and would like help from the community."
msgstr ""
"**Neds: ajuda de la comunitat**: els mantenidors actualment no tenen "
"capacitat per resoldre aquest problema i els agradaria l'ajuda de la "
"comunitat."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Needs: confirmation/more info**: the bug needs confirmation and / or "
"further detailing by affected users."
msgstr ""
"**needs confirmation**: Cal confirmació - A l'error li cal confirmació i / o"
"  més informació dels usuaris afectats"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Needs: feedback from author**: used to flag a merge request which requires "
"a feedback from author after a review. This is different from **Needs: "
"confirmation/more info** which is intended to be used on an issue."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: feedback from author**: s'utilitza per marcar una sol·licitud de "
"fusió que requereix una retroalimentació de l'autor després d'una revisió. "
"Això és diferent de **Needs: confirmació/més informació** que està destinat "
"a ser utilitzat en un problema."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Needs: discussion**: it is not clear how to solve this issue and further "
"discussion is required."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: discussió**: no està clar com resoldre aquest problema i es "
"requereix més discussió."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Needs: rebase**: this merge request has to be rebased, but maintainers do "
"not have a permission to push to the source branch."
msgstr ""
"**Needs: rebase**: aquesta sol·licitud de fusió s'ha de tornar a basar, però "
"els mantenidors no tenen permís per empènyer a la branca d'origen."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:52
msgid "**Severity:** how severe is the issue."
msgstr "**Severitat:** com de greu és el problema."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Severity: critical**: this issue is very severe and should block the "
"rollout of the release (defined by its milestone)."
msgstr ""
"**Severitat: crítica**: aquest problema és molt greu i hauria de bloquejar "
"el desplegament de la versió (definida per la seva fita)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Area:** this issue is related to a certain area of Ubuntu Touch (e.g. HAL, "
"middleware, UI). Labels of this prefix can be created as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"**Àrea:** aquest problema està relacionat amb una àrea determinada d'Ubuntu "
"Touch (p. ex. HAL, middleware, UI). Les etiquetes d'aquest prefix es poden "
"crear segons correspongui."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Topic:** this issue is related to a certain topic of interest (e.g. VoLTE, "
"contact backend migration). Labels of this prefix can also be created as "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"**Topic:** aquest problema està relacionat amb un tema d'interès determinat "
"(p. ex. VoLTE, migració del dorsal de contacte). Les etiquetes d'aquest "
"prefix també es poden crear segons correspongui."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Resolution:** used when the issue is closed for other reason than the "
"issue being fixed."
msgstr ""
"**Resolució:** utilitzada quan es tanca el problema per una altra raó que el "
"problema que s'està solucionant."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Resolution: unable to confirm**: we are unable to reproduce the issue and "
"not enough information is provided."
msgstr ""
"**Resolució: no es pot confirmar**: no es pot reproduir el problema i no es "
"proporciona prou informació."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Resolution: not our bug**: the issue is not an issue in Ubuntu Touch, but "
"rather is an issue in a third-party software installed by the user."
msgstr ""
"**Resolució: no és el nostre error**: el problema no és un problema a Ubuntu "
"Touch, sinó que és un problema en un programari de tercers instal·lat per "
"l'usuari."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Resolution: won't fix**: A bug it does not make sense to fix, since it "
"will probably resolve itself, be too much work, isn't fixable, or an "
"underlying component will soon change."
msgstr ""
"**wontfix**: No s'arreglarà - No té sentit arreglar aquest error, atès que "
"probablement s'arreglarà per sí mateix, implicaria molta feina arreglar-lo, "
"no es pot arreglar, o algun component subjacent canviarà aviat."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Resolution: work as intended**: The behavior described in the issue is the "
"intended behavior of the software."
msgstr ""
"**Resolució: treball segons el que es pretén**: El comportament descrit en "
"el problema és el comportament previst del programari."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Backport to: <branch name>**: used by the automation to automatically "
"backport an MR to a stable release branches."
msgstr ""
"**Aporta a: <branch name>**: utilitzat per l'automatització per tornar "
"enrere automàticament un MR a una branca d'alliberament estable."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:62
msgid "Miscellaneous labels"
msgstr "Etiquetes diverses"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:63
msgid ""
"**Good first issue**: the report contains instructions or hints required to "
"fix it. It is an excellent place for someone new to learn about the project "
"by fixing a real issue."
msgstr ""
"**Bon primer problema**: l'informe conté instruccions o consells necessaris "
"per a solucionar-lo. És un lloc excel·lent perquè algú nou aprengui sobre el "
"projecte solucionant un problema real."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Hotfix**: This MR/issue classifies for being included/resolved as part of "
"a point release of Ubuntu Touch"
msgstr ""
"**Hotfix**: Aquest MR/issue classifica per ser inclòs/resolt com a part d'un "
"llançament puntual d'Ubuntu Touch"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:67
msgid ""
"If a repository tracking issues locally defines it's own labels, they should "
"be documented in the README.md."
msgstr ""
"Si un repositori que segueix els problemes localment defineix les seves "
"pròpies etiquetes, s'haurien de documentar al README.md."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:73
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estat"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:75
msgid ""
"Status field is used to indicate the progress of the issue. We've defined "
"the following statuses:"
msgstr ""
"El camp Estat s'utilitza per indicar el progrés de la incidència. Hem "
"definit els següents estats:"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:77
msgid ""
"**New**: This is the status for a newly-opened issue. This indicates that "
"this issue is untriaged; Developers and triagers are encouraged to triage "
"issues, assigns kind and other labels, decide whether this issue warrants a "
"milestone, etc. Alternatively, if an issue is a work item, a tracking issue, "
"or something similar filed by developers, this status can be skipped."
msgstr ""
"**Nou**: Aquest és l'estat d'un problema recentment obert. Això indica que "
"aquest problema no està provat; s'anima als desenvolupadors i trígers a "
"triar els problemes, assignar tipus i altres etiquetes, decidir si aquesta "
"qüestió justifica una fita, etc. Alternativament, si un problema és un "
"element de treball, un problema de seguiment, o alguna cosa similar "
"presentat pels desenvolupadors, aquest estat es pot ometre."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Ready to be worked on**: Indicates that this issue is triaged and can be "
"worked on."
msgstr ""
"**Ready to be worked on**: Indica que aquest problema es tria i es pot "
"treballar."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:81
msgid "This status replaces default \"To do\" status."
msgstr "Aquest estat substitueix l'estat predeterminat de «Fer»."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Blocked**: Indicates that something else has to be solved outside of this "
"issue before this issue can progress."
msgstr ""
"**Bloquejat**: Indica que una altra cosa s'ha de resoldre fora d'aquest "
"problema abans que aquest problema pugui progressar."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:84
msgid ""
"**In progress**: Indicates that a developer is actively working on the "
"issue. The issue should be assigned to that developer."
msgstr ""
"**En progrés**: Indica que un desenvolupador està treballant activament en "
"el problema. La qüestió s'ha d'assignar a aquest desenvolupador."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:85
msgid "**Has MR**: A non-draft MR exists that will fix this issue."
msgstr ""
"**Ha MR**: Hi ha un MR que no és un projecte que solucionarà aquest problema."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:86
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Done**: The issue has been fixed in the ``main`` branch."
msgstr "**Fet**: El problema s'ha solucionat a la branca  themain.."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Duplicate**: The issue is a duplicate. GitLab sets this status "
"automatically when the issue is marked as a duplicate."
msgstr ""
"**Duplica**: El problema és un duplicat. GitLab estableix aquest estat "
"automàticament quan el problema està marcat com a duplicat."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Won't do**: The issue is closed for other reason than the issue being "
"fixed. It should have \"Resolution: \\*\" labels to explain the reason (see "
"above)."
msgstr ""
"**No ho faré**: El problema es tanca per una altra raó que el problema que "
"s'està solucionant. Hauria de tenir etiquetes \"Resolució: \\*\" per "
"explicar el motiu (vegeu més amunt)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:91
msgid "Milestones"
msgstr "Fites"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:93
msgid ""
"Milestones are used to define which release an issue targets. At a given "
"time, up to 3 milestones are open:"
msgstr ""
"Les fites s'utilitzen per definir quin alliberar un objectiu d'emissió. En "
"un moment donat, s'obren fins a 3 fites:"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:95
msgid ""
"A milestone for the upcoming stable release e.g. 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-1.1'."
msgstr ""
"Una fita per al proper llançament estable, p. ex. 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-1.1'."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:96
msgid ""
"A milestone for the in development major release e.g. 'Ubuntu Touch "
"24.04-2.0'."
msgstr ""
"Una fita per al llançament principal en desenvolupament, p. ex. 'Ubuntu "
"Touch 24.04-2.0'."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:97
msgid ""
"Once the in development release enters a stabilization phase, a milestone "
"for the next major release (e.g. 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-3.0') can be created."
msgstr ""
"Una vegada que el llançament en desenvolupament entra en una fase "
"d'estabilització, es pot crear una fita per al següent llançament principal "
"(p. ex. 'Ubuntu Touch 24.04-3.0')."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:99
msgid ""
"Developers are encouraged to avoid assigning too many issues to a milestone; "
"an overflowing milestone makes the milestone not as useful as it could be in "
"tracking progress of a release."
msgstr ""
"S'anima als desenvolupadors a evitar assignar massa problemes a una fita; "
"una fita desbordant fa que la fita no sigui tan útil com podria ser en el "
"seguiment del progrés d'un llançament."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:102
msgid "Assignees"
msgstr "Assignats"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:104
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "To make it transparent who's working on an issue, the developer should be "
#| "assigned. This also allows the use of GitHub's global filtering as a type "
#| "of TODO list. For example, `this is everything assigned to mariogrip in "
#| "@ubports <https://github.com/search?"
#| "utf8=%E2%9C%93&q=is%3Aopen+org%3Aubports+assignee%3Amariogrip&type=>`_."
msgid ""
"To make it transparent who's working on an issue, the developer should be "
"assigned. This also allows the use of GitLab's global filtering as a type of "
"TODO list."
msgstr ""
"Per fer transparent qui està treballant en un problema, s'hauria d'assignar "
"el desenvolupador. Això permet també usar el filtratge global de GItHub com "
"una mena de llista de tasques pendents. Per exemple, `això és tot el que "
"està assignat a mariogrip a @ubports <https://github.com/"
"search?utf8=%E2%9C%93&q=is%3Aopen+org%3Aubports+assignee%3Amariogrip&type=>"
"`_."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:108
msgid ""
"Developers are encouraged to keep their list short and update the status of "
"their issues."
msgstr ""
"Es demana als desenvolupadors de mantenir la seva llista curta i mantenir "
"actualitzat l'estat del seus problemes."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:111
msgid "GitLab issue board"
msgstr "Tauler d'errors del GitLab"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:113
msgid ""
"We use GitLab's issue boards to visualize progress of issues in each "
"milestone. The boards are kanban boards, where each column corresponds to "
"each defined status (new, ready to be worked on, blocked, in progress, has "
"MR, done, duplicate, won't do)."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzem els taulers d'emissió de GitLab per visualitzar el progrés dels "
"problemes en cada fita. Els taulers són taulers kanban, on cada columna "
"correspon a cada estat definit (nou, preparat per ser treballat, bloquejat, "
"en curs, té MR, fet, duplicat, no ho farà)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:116
msgid "GitLab epic"
msgstr "Èpica del GitLab"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:118
msgid ""
"We use GitLab's epics to denote a topic which might span single or multiple "
"milestones/releases. This helps organizing some long-term goals which are "
"too large to implement at once."
msgstr ""
"Utilitzem les èpiques de GitLab per denotar un tema que podria abastar fites/"
"llançaments individuals o múltiples. Això ajuda a organitzar alguns "
"objectius a llarg termini que són massa grans per implementar alhora."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:121
msgid "How labels, milestone etc. are being used?"
msgstr "Com s'estan utilitzant les etiquetes, les fites, etc.?"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:123
msgid ""
"Think of labels, milestone, and other fields as tools a person can use to "
"efficiently communicate with the reporter, other developers, and interested "
"parties. They could be use in a few ways:"
msgstr ""
"Penseu en les etiquetes, les fites i altres camps com a eines que una "
"persona pot utilitzar per comunicar-se eficientment amb el reporter, altres "
"desenvolupadors i parts interessades. Es podrien utilitzar de diverses "
"maneres:"

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:125
msgid ""
"Because those fields show up in the issue list, it can give an at-a-glance "
"info about the issue, helping developers to quickly understand the issue. "
"For example, a developer could look at an issue on the list, notice that the "
"issue has \"needs discussion\" label, and decide to jump in to give their 2 "
"cents."
msgstr ""
"Com que aquests camps es mostren a la llista d'incidències, pot donar una "
"informació a-a-glance sobre el problema, ajudant els desenvolupadors a "
"comprendre ràpidament el problema. Per exemple, un desenvolupador podria "
"mirar un problema a la llista, notar que el problema té etiqueta \"necessita "
"discussió\", i decidir saltar per donar els seus 2 cèntims."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:126
msgid ""
"A field could be used to filter only interested issues. For example, a "
"community member wanting to contribute into confirming issues can filter "
"only issues with \"needs confirmation\" label and start jumping in."
msgstr ""
"Un camp es podria utilitzar per filtrar només els problemes interessats. Per "
"exemple, un membre de la comunitat que vulgui contribuir a confirmar "
"problemes pot filtrar només problemes amb l'etiqueta \"necessita "
"confirmació\" i començar a saltar."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:127
msgid ""
"A field could also be used to filter out uninteresting issues. For example, "
"when a developer want to look for an issue to work on, one would want to "
"filter out \"Kind: process\" label (used for e.g. tracking issue for a "
"release)."
msgstr ""
"També es podria utilitzar un camp per filtrar problemes no interessants. Per "
"exemple, quan un desenvolupador vol buscar un problema en el qual treballar, "
"es vol filtrar l'etiqueta \"Kind: process\" (utilitzada per exemple per al "
"seguiment d'un problema per a una versió)."

#: ../../about/process/issue-tracking.rst:129
msgid ""
"Since we don't always have someone to specifically triage issues and set "
"those labels, developers are encouraged to set all those fields as they work "
"on an issue. This will help comminicating what has been done on the issue, "
"and also help summarizing the issue for quicker understanding."
msgstr ""
"Com que no sempre tenim algú que triï específicament els problemes i "
"estableixi aquestes etiquetes, s'anima als desenvolupadors a establir tots "
"aquests camps a mesura que treballen en un problema. Això ajudarà a "
"minimitzar el que s'ha fet sobre el tema, i també ajudarà a resumir el "
"problema per a una comprensió més ràpida."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:2
msgid "Release Schedule"
msgstr "Calendari d'alliberament"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:3
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Touch has four software update channels: Stable, Release Candidate, "
"Devel, and Edge."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Touch té quatre canals d'actualització de programari: Stable, Release "
"Candidate, Devel i Edge."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:6
msgid "Stable Channel"
msgstr "Canal estable"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:7
msgid ""
"**It is the most reliable release channel.** It is recommended for users who "
"prefer stability rather than the newest features. Generally Stable gets OTA "
"(over the air) updates every several weeks. But there is no firm schedule. "
"Releases are ready when they're ready. Stable releases should not introduce "
"new bugs or ship very incomplete features."
msgstr ""
"**És el canal de llançament més fiable.** Es recomana per als usuaris que "
"prefereixen l'estabilitat en lloc de les funcions més noves. Generalment "
"Stable rep actualitzacions OTA (sobre l'aire) cada diverses setmanes. Però "
"no hi ha un calendari ferm. Els llançaments estan llestos quan estiguin "
"llestos. Els llançaments estables no haurien d'introduir errors nous o "
"enviar característiques molt incompletes."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:15
msgid "Release Candidate (RC) Channel"
msgstr "Canal Release Candidate (RC)"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:16
msgid ""
"**It is relatively stable but may occasionally contain bugs.** This channel "
"is for doing the last tests before releasing features to the Stable channel. "
"If you want features quicker, and you want to help to test, but your life "
"does not depend on your phone, and you can live with some downtime - RC is "
"for you. It does get updates generally every week."
msgstr ""
"**És relativament estable, però pot contenir errors ocasionalment.** Aquest "
"canal és per a fer les últimes proves abans de llançar funcions al canal "
"Stable. Si voleu funcions més ràpid, i voleu ajudar a provar, però la seva "
"vida no depèn del seu telèfon, i es pot viure amb una mica de temps "
"d'inactivitat - RC és per a vostè. En general, s'actualitzen cada setmana."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:22
msgid "Devel Channel"
msgstr "Desplaça el canal"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:23
msgid ""
"**This is where new features land for the first testing.** Although changes "
"have been validated before being released, bugs are to be expected. Don't "
"use Devel if you can't live with the fact that new features might break "
"things. Updates come if something has changed - so frequency can be daily."
msgstr ""
"**Aquí és on aterren les noves característiques per a les primeres proves.** "
"Tot i que els canvis s'han validat abans de publicar-se, cal esperar errors. "
"No utilitzeu Devel si no podeu viure amb el fet que les noves "
"característiques podrien trencar les coses. Les actualitzacions venen si "
"alguna cosa ha canviat - de manera que la freqüència pot ser diària."

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:29
msgid "Edge Channel"
msgstr "Canal de la vora"

#: ../../about/process/release-schedule.rst:30
msgid ""
"**This is where dragons live.** Here ideas and big new features are melted "
"into code for developers to work on and for the fearless to try them out. "
"Don't set this channel on a phone you use daily. Updates come as ideas "
"happen to developers. Sometimes very frequently, sometimes the channel isn't "
"used at all. Basically, if you need to ask what's in Edge, then it is not "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"**Aquí és on viuen els dracs.** Aquí les idees i les grans novetats es fonen "
"en codi perquè els desenvolupadors treballin i perquè els sense por puguin "
"provar-les. No estableixis aquest canal en un telèfon que utilitzis "
"diàriament. Les actualitzacions venen a mesura que passen les idees als "
"desenvolupadors. De vegades amb molta freqüència, de vegades el canal no "
"s'utilitza en absolut. Bàsicament, si necessites preguntar què hi ha a Edge, "
"llavors no és per a tu."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:2
msgid "Security vulnerabilities"
msgstr "Seguretat i aïllament de les aplicacions"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:4
msgid ""
"We take security vulnerabilities seriously. If you've found one, the best "
"way to report it is to create a confidential issue on our `bug tracker "
"<https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/ubuntu-touch>`_. Make sure you "
"select \"This issue is confidential and should only be visible to team "
"members with at least Reporter access\" when creating the issue. After that, "
"we'll get to work with the reported issue. We might contact you via the "
"issue if there is additional information needed. And we'll determine the "
"disclosure."
msgstr ""
"Ens prenem seriosament les vulnerabilitats de seguretat. Si n'heu trobat "
"una, la millor manera d'informar-ne és crear un problema confidencial al "
"nostre .seguidor d'errors <https://gitlab.com/ubports/development/ubuntu-"
"touch>.. Assegureu-vos que seleccioneu \"Aquesta incidència és confidencial "
"i només ha de ser visible per als membres de l'equip amb almenys accés "
"Reporter\" quan creeu el problema. Després d'això, arribarem a treballar amb "
"el problema reportat. Podem posar-nos en contacte amb vostè a través del "
"problema si es necessita informació addicional. I determinarem la revelació."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:7
msgid "How to handle a security fix"
msgstr "Com gestionar una solució de seguretat"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:9
msgid ""
"For UBports development members, these are recommended steps to handle "
"fixing the issue without disclosing to public before the fix is ready:"
msgstr ""
"Per als membres de desenvolupament d'UBports, aquests són passos recomanats "
"per gestionar la solució del problema sense revelar al públic abans que la "
"solució estigui llesta:"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:11
msgid ""
"Given a main repo, ensure that the ``<project>.secfix`` repo exists. If not, "
"fork from the main project to the same namespace, but set the visibility to "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Donat un dipòsit principal, assegureu-vos que el dipòsit ``<project>"
".secfix`` existeix. Si no, bifurca des del projecte principal al mateix "
"espai de noms, però estableix la visibilitat a privat."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:13
msgid ""
"The ``.secfix`` suffix will prevent CI from touching this repo, preventing "
"the repo from leaking."
msgstr ""
"El sufix ``.secfix`` evitarà que CI toqui aquest dipòsit, evitant que el "
"dipòsit es filtri."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:15
msgid ""
"If there isn't an issue for it already, create a confidential issue on the "
"main project."
msgstr ""
"Si ja no hi ha cap problema, crea un problema confidencial en el projecte "
"principal."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:16
msgid ""
"On the issue, use \"Create confidential merge request\". Set the branch name "
"and the source branch appropriately. Then, push to this branch from your "
"local Git tree."
msgstr ""
"Sobre el tema, utilitzeu \"Crea una sol·licitud de fusió confidencial\". "
"Establiu el nom de la branca i la branca d'origen de manera adequada. "
"Després, empenyeu a aquesta branca des del vostre arbre local de Git."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:18
msgid ""
"This MR will target the ``.secfix`` repo, NOT the main repo [1]_. This "
"allows reviewing the patch to happen in private."
msgstr ""
"Aquest MR es dirigirà al dipòsit ``.secfix``, NO al principal [1]_. Això "
"permet revisar el pegat en privat."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:20
msgid ""
"Another developer then reviews and merges the merge request. If backport is "
"needed, it must also happen in the ``.secfix`` fork."
msgstr ""
"Un altre desenvolupador revisa i fusiona la sol·licitud de fusió. Si es "
"necessita el backport, també ha de passar a la bifurcació ``.secfix``."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:22
msgid ""
"Since we don't have confidential CI yet, it is both the developer and "
"reviewer's responsibility to ensure that the code will compile, pass tests, "
"and is tested locally."
msgstr ""
"Com que encara no tenim CI confidencial, és responsabilitat tant del "
"desenvolupador com del revisor assegurar que el codi compili, passi proves i "
"es provi localment."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:24
msgid ""
"At ~1 day before the release date of a release candidate, a developer "
"(usually the release manager) merges all branches of ``.secfix`` repo to the "
"main repo. After that, the confidential issue is marked unconfidential. This "
"makes the issue public for the first time."
msgstr ""
"A 1 dia abans de la data de llançament d'un candidat a llançament, un "
"desenvolupador (normalment el gestor de llançament) fusiona totes les "
"branques del repositori ``.secfix`` al repositori principal. Després d'això, "
"la qüestió confidencial es marca com a no confidencial. Això fa públic el "
"tema per primera vegada."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:26
msgid ""
"At this point, it is this developer's responsibility to ensure that the "
"merge result actually passes CI and that at least the basic functionality of "
"this component is not broken."
msgstr ""
"En aquest punt, és responsabilitat d'aquest desenvolupador assegurar que el "
"resultat de la fusió realment passa CI i que almenys la funcionalitat bàsica "
"d'aquest component no es trenca."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:28
msgid ""
"The release manager will ensure that the fix actually lands in the daily "
"image before choosing such image as an RC."
msgstr ""
"El gestor de llançament s'assegurarà que la solució realment aterra a la "
"imatge diària abans de triar aquesta imatge com una RC."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:29
msgid ""
"Before the release date, the fixing developer will prepare the security "
"advisory, containing (the list is inspired by Curl's advisories [2]_):"
msgstr ""
"Abans de la data de llançament, el desenvolupador de correcció prepararà "
"l'assessorament de seguretat, que conté (la llista s'inspira en els consells "
"de Curl [2]_):"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:32
msgid "Vulnerability (how a user is vulnerable)"
msgstr "Vulnerabilitat (com un usuari és vulnerable)"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:33
msgid "Info (how the vulnerable exists)"
msgstr "Informació (com existeix el vulnerable)"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:34
msgid "Affected versions"
msgstr "Versions afectades"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:35
msgid "Solution"
msgstr "Resolució"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:36
msgid "Recommendations"
msgstr "Recomanacions"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:37
msgid "Timeline"
msgstr "Línia de temps"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:38
msgid "Credit"
msgstr "Crèdit"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:40
msgid ""
"At the release date, the security advisory will be published on the forum, "
"in the \"OS > Security advisories\" section."
msgstr ""
"A la data de llançament, l'assessoria de seguretat es publicarà al fòrum, a "
"l'apartat \"OS . Assessors de seguretat\"."

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:42
msgid ""
"https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/merge_requests/"
"confidential.html#create-a-confidential-merge-request"
msgstr ""
"https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/mergerequests/"
"confidential.html.create-a-confidential-merge-request"

#: ../../about/process/security-vulnerabilities.rst:43
msgid "https://curl.se/docs/security.html"
msgstr "https://curl.se/docs/security.html"

