#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:12
msgid ""
"See a `list of the icons <http://docs.ubports.com/projects/icons/>`__. "
"available in the system."
msgstr ""
"`Llegiu els documents <https://docs.ubuntu.com/phone/en/platform/>`__\n"
"Translation"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:15
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Color"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:17
msgid ""
"Interface icons can be colourized in qml therefore are designed in #808080 "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Les icones d'interfície es poden acolorir en qml, per tant, estan "
"dissenyades en color 80808080."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:20
msgid "Font"
msgstr "Tipus de lletra"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:22
msgid ""
"To provide a consistent look to the UI and to make the Suru icons "
"distinctive, the design is based on the same patterns as the Ubuntu font. "
"The font patterns can applied to the symbol to define its contours."
msgstr ""
"Per proporcionar una mirada coherent a la interfície d'usuari i fer que les "
"icones Suru siguin distintives, el disseny es basa en els mateixos patrons "
"que la font d'Ubuntu. Els patrons de tipus de lletra es poden aplicar al "
"símbol per definir els seus contorns."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:29
msgid "Strokes"
msgstr "Traços"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:31
msgid ""
"Stroke ends are squared but the upper end of vertical strokes is slightly "
"oblique with a +10º angle."
msgstr ""
"Els extrems dels traços són quadrats, però l'extrem superior dels traços "
"verticals és lleugerament oblic amb un angle +10o."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:38
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "ubicació"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:40
msgid ""
"When they are not horizontal or vertical, objects are oriented along a +45º "
"axis."
msgstr ""
"Quan no són horitzontals o verticals, els objectes estan orientats al llarg "
"d'un eix +45o."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:47
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "Cantonades"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:49
msgid ""
"Curved corners are preferred if possible. The following picture shows a zoom "
"on the default outer and inner curvatures, with nodes and Bezier handle. The "
"default curvature can be scaled down when the shape is smaller."
msgstr ""
"Es prefereixen les cantonades corbades si és possible. La següent imatge "
"mostra un zoom sobre les curvatures externes i internes predeterminades, amb "
"nodes i nansa de Bézier. La curvatura per defecte es pot reduir quan la "
"forma és més petita."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:56
msgid "Arrows"
msgstr "Fletxes"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:58
msgid ""
"A chevron symbol is used for navigation arrows. The arrowhead is an "
"isosceles triangle where the two equal sides are slightly curved (following "
"the pattern of the Y character)."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitza un símbol de chevron per a les fletxes de navegació. La punta de "
"fletxa és un triangle isòsceles on els dos costats iguals són lleugerament "
"corbats (seguint el patró del caràcter Y)."

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:65
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Opacitat"

#: ../../humanguide/design-concepts/in-app-icons-design.rst:67
msgid ""
"50% opacity is used to reflect the status of an indicator. In case of a "
"double space (enabled and disabled, for example), the opacity of the whole "
"icon changes. When the status allows a range of values, the opacity of a "
"single portion of icon can be altered."
msgstr ""
"S'utilitza un 50% d'opacitat per reflectir l'estat d'un indicador. En cas "
"d'un espai doble (activat i desactivat, per exemple), l'opacitat de tota la "
