#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:140
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Defconfig is a vital part of the kernel compilation process. Most of the "
"times you can find this defconfig in your kernel source, the path to which "
"is \"arch/<your architecture>/configs\". The defconfig's name is often built "
"up like \"<your codename>_defconfig\". After finding your defconfig, replace "
"it as necessary. You also need to add ``halium.config`` in this field, due "
"to adding the kernel config patches above. (If you still can't find the "
"defconfig refer to section \"Finding your defconfig\")"
msgstr ""
"Defconfig és una part vital del procés de compilació del nucli. La majoria "
"de vegades podeu trobar aquest defconfig a la font del nucli, el camí al "
"qual és \"arch/<your architecture>/configs\". El nom de defconfig sovint es "
"construeix com \"<your codename>defconfig\". Després de trobar el vostre "
"defconfig, substituïu-lo segons sigui necessari. També heu d'afegir "
".halium.config. en aquest camp, a causa d'afegir els pedaços de configuració "
"del nucli anteriors. (Si encara no podeu trobar la defconfig, consulteu la "
"secció \"Finding your defconfig\")"

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:144
#, fuzzy
msgid "``deviceinfo_kernel_defconfig=\"angelica_defconfig halium.config\"``"
msgstr "deviceinfokerneldefconfig \"angelicadefconfig halium.config\"\""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:147
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The kernel cmdline is one of the key things that is required to make the "
"kernel boot. It has special parameters that allow the kernel to determine "
"which features/things need to be enabled, and which need to be disabled. The "
"Ubuntu Touch rootfs also relies on some key cmdlines which is required to "
"boot, most specifically \"console=tty0\". To adapt this to your device, try "
"unpacking your boot image (section 8.3) and copying the cmdline from there, "
"or take the help of a LineageOS device tree if it is available. "
"\"console=tty0\" is a must for cmdline and should not be removed no matter "
"what. Rest of the things can be removed and you can adjust these to your "
"device. ``console=tty0`` is a requirement for the rootfs to properly boot. "
"``systempart`` is added if you want to boot your rootfs from your system "
"partition. It is supposed to point to your system partition."
msgstr ""
"El nucli cmdline és una de les coses clau que es requereixen per a fer que "
"el nucli arrenqui. Té paràmetres especials que permeten al nucli determinar "
"quines característiques/coses s'han d'habilitar i quines s'han "
"d'inhabilitar. Els rootfs d'Ubuntu Touch també es basen en algunes línies "
"cmd clau que es requereixen per arrencar, més específicament "
"\"console\".tty0\". Per adaptar-ho al vostre dispositiu, proveu de "
"desempaquetar la vostra imatge d'arrencada (secció 8.3) i copiar la línia cm "
"d'allà, o preneu l'ajuda d'un arbre de dispositius LineageOS si està "
"disponible. \"console.tty0\" és un must per a cmdline i no s'ha de treure no "
"importa el que. La resta de les coses es poden eliminar i podeu ajustar-les "
"al vostre dispositiu. .console.tty0. és un requisit perquè el rootfs "
"arrenqui correctament. .systempart. s'afegeix si voleu arrencar el vostre "
"rootfs des de la partició del sistema. Se suposa que apunta a la partició "
"del vostre sistema."

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:150
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``deviceinfo_kernel_cmdline=\"console=tty0 bootopt=64S3,32N2,64N2 "
"systempart=/dev/mapper/system\"``"
msgstr ""
"deviceinfokernelcmdline \"console=tty0 bootopt\"64S3,32N2,64N2 systempart//"
"dev/mapper/system\"\""

#: ../../porting/build_and_boot/standalone_kernel_build.rst:153
