#: ../../porting/introduction/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Porting is the process of making Ubuntu Touch run on new hardware, i.e. on "
"devices that have not previously been able to run Ubuntu Touch."
msgstr ""
"Porting és el procés de fer que Ubuntu Touch s'executi en un maquinari nou, "
"és a dir, en dispositius que no han estat capaços d'executar Ubuntu Touch."

#: ../../porting/introduction/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"On the vast majority of commercially available devices crucial parts of "
"their systems are not open source. Furthermore, these proprietary parts are "
"specific, not only to the manufacturer, but usually also to the individual "
"model."
msgstr ""
"En la gran majoria dels dispositius disponibles comercialment parts crucials "
"dels seus sistemes no són de codi obert. A més, aquestes parts propietàries "
"són específiques, no només per al fabricant, sinó normalment també per al "
"model individual."

#: ../../porting/introduction/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Porting Ubuntu Touch involves building it in such a way as to integrate it "
"with these proprietary components on a device so as to enable it to \"talk "
"to\" the device hardware."
msgstr ""
"Portar Ubuntu Touch implica construir-lo de tal manera que s'integri amb "
"aquests components propietaris en un dispositiu per tal de permetre-li "
"\"parlar\" amb el maquinari del dispositiu."

#: ../../porting/introduction/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"Before attempting to port Ubuntu Touch to a new device, there are a few "
"things to understand and consider, some research to be done, and a suitable "
"build environment needs to be set up. This section addresses these points."
msgstr ""
"Abans d'intentar portar Ubuntu Touch a un nou dispositiu, hi ha algunes "
"coses a entendre i considerar, algunes investigacions a fer, i cal "
"configurar un entorn de construcció adequat. Aquesta secció aborda aquests "
"punts."

